--Description / Thinking process:
-- 1. Objective: Display Lewis Hamilton’s race participations with season (year), round, driver_id,
--    his full name, and the constructor he raced for.
-- 2. Required tables:
--      a) results   – holds race results with driver_id, constructor_id, race_id.
--      b) races     – supplies year and round via race_id.
--      c) drivers   – provides driver names via driver_id.
-- 3. Joins:
--      results → races   on race_id to get year/round.
--      results → drivers on driver_id to get driver details.
-- 4. Fix previous error: use alias “d” (drivers) instead of undefined “dr”.
-- 5. DISTINCT to avoid duplicates; ORDER BY year & round; LIMIT 20 for concise preview.

SELECT DISTINCT
       r.year,
       r.round,
       d.driver_id,
       d.forename || ' ' || d.surname AS driver,
       res.constructor_id
FROM results  AS res
JOIN races    AS r ON r.race_id   = res.race_id
JOIN drivers  AS d ON d.driver_id = res.driver_id
WHERE d.driver_id = 1                  -- Lewis Hamilton
ORDER BY r.year, r.round
LIMIT 20;
```
